 you can fully participate in the world around you. With superior guidance, clinical excellence, and care centered on you, we partner with our patients and their families each and every day.','9:00am - 5:00pm','9:00am - 5:00pm','9:00am - 5:00pm','9:00am - 5:00pm','9:00am - 5:00pm','9:00am - 1:00pm','Closed','https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3134!2d-84.5603!3d38.2098!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zMzjCsDEyJzM1LjMiTiA4NMKwMzMnMzcuMSJX!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1234567890','Audiology Services in Georgetown, KY','At Commonwealth Audiology, we provide hearing care to meet your every need. It''s our commitment to make sure you can hear every moment clearly.','Hearing Aids & Hearing Aid Services','We provide best-in-class hearing aid solutions with expert fittings, adjustments, repairs, and ongoing maintenance so you can hear your best every day.','Hearing Protection Solutions in Georgetown, KY','For anyone exposed to loud noise, custom ear protection offers the safest and most comfortable way to preserve your hearing.','What Our Patients Are Saying','Frequently Asked Questions','News & Articles',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Compassionate hearing care in Georgetown, KY. Helping you hear every meaningful moment of life.');
